In response to the news, Minister Hoshikawa
has claimed that one of his secretaries,

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:27.580
Under Suspicion
Minister Hikaru Hoshikawa's
Illegal Use of Funds!
Utako Sekiguchi, played a main role
in the misappropriation of funds.

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:28.910
What?!

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:33.120
Minister Hikaru Hoshikawa's
Illegal Use of Funds!
I exercised poor judgement as Minister by not
scrutinizing the actions of my secretaries closely.

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:34.590
Minister Hikaru Hoshikawa's
Illegal Use of Funds!
It was you! Fess up!

00:11:34.580 --> 00:11:36.540
Minister Hikaru Hoshikawa's
Illegal Use of Funds!
Matsukata-san, please don't
throw things in the office!
Don't put the blame on your secretary!

00:11:36.540 --> 00:11:36.920
Matsukata-san, please don't
throw things in the office!

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:39.250
Calm down, Matsukata-san!
Matsukata-san, you've got a call on line 2.

00:11:40.580 --> 00:11:42.750
Yes, this is Matsukata. Yes.

00:11:43.170 --> 00:11:44.130
What?!

00:11:45.170 --> 00:11:46.920
And I'm telling you, I have no idea
what you're talking about!

00:11:46.920 --> 00:11:50.380
I'm not the one being stubborn! "You'll take me
to court"? How about you name yourself first!

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:54.750
Excuse me, I'm sorry to interrupt.
This is Matsukata's supervisor.

00:11:54.750 --> 00:11:55.540
Narita-san!

00:11:56.170 --> 00:11:57.670
Don't lose your cool.

00:11:58.250 --> 00:12:01.380
But... he said, "You're dead
if you print another lie"...

00:12:01.380 --> 00:12:03.460
Yes. Thank you for calling.

00:12:04.880 --> 00:12:08.590
I-I'm very sorry for causing you trouble.

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:11.290
It's okay, I don't mind.

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:14.460
But if you keep picking fights with guys like that,
they'll show up at your house.

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:18.000
You're the one who will ultimately end up in trouble,
so I'm telling you to be more careful.

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:23.840
N..Narita-san is such a great guy.
I wonder why he's still single?

00:12:23.830 --> 00:12:25.710
He's not interested in women.

00:12:25.710 --> 00:12:28.000
I'm into all kinds of women, you know.

00:12:28.000 --> 00:12:29.040
Editor-In-Chief!

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:33.000
Where have you been?!
We've had trouble all morning!

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:34.040
What trouble?

00:12:34.040 --> 00:12:36.750
Ah, Matsukata received a threatening phone call.

00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:38.290
What? A real one?

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:40.790
Yes, but we managed to take care of it.

00:12:41.580 --> 00:12:43.910
Let me guess, the responsibility
fell on my shoulders again.

00:12:44.420 --> 00:12:46.800
They seemed satisfied
once I mentioned your name.

00:12:52.130 --> 00:12:57.760
Um, may I ask why you've decided
to share this information with me?

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:02.580
I think it's because of how upset you were
on that day we met.

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:06.300
They cut your interview short,
so you were cussing them out, right?

00:13:09.380 --> 00:13:12.840
It made me remember
that I've also had some similar experiences.

00:13:13.630 --> 00:13:15.880
I wonder what made me so desperate back then...

00:13:17.540 --> 00:13:20.120
Desperation... Is that what drove her?

00:13:21.130 --> 00:13:25.380
I thought she was prepared
for what would happen after I wrote the article...

00:13:29.170 --> 00:13:30.340
Am I just imagining it?

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:36.750
No, it's real. I'm being followed!

00:13:37.210 --> 00:13:40.340
But if you keep picking fights with guys like that,
they'll show up at your house.

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:43.460
Hi, Shinji? I'll be home soon.

00:13:43.710 --> 00:13:44.880
The number you have dialed is currently busy. If you'd like to-

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:47.510
Okay, yeah. Start heating up the bathtub for me.
The number you have dialed is currently busy. If you'd like to-

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:49.920
Keys. I have to open the door
and immediately lock it.

00:13:54.630 --> 00:13:56.800
If they're already in front of my door,
then I'm screwed.

00:13:57.250 --> 00:13:59.790
I can't let my guard down
until I'm in my room and the door is locked.

00:14:10.210 --> 00:14:12.170
Shinji

00:14:13.420 --> 00:14:15.380
Sorry, did you just call me?

00:14:15.380 --> 00:14:20.630
Shinji? Someone was following me
on my way home... I was so scared!

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:23.420
I keep telling you to use a taxi
when you're leaving work late!

00:14:24.580 --> 00:14:27.040
Please, just come here right now.

00:14:27.330 --> 00:14:28.410
I'm scared!

00:14:28.920 --> 00:14:33.130
Of course I want to, but I'm leaving
on a business trip to Sendai tomorrow.

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:36.620
If I were in his shoes,
I would probably say the same thing.

00:14:36.880 --> 00:14:41.260
But if tears start coming out, then I know
he'll run over here even if it costs him sleep.

00:14:42.460 --> 00:14:43.710
So I'm not going to cry.

00:14:44.580 --> 00:14:47.370
Business trips are important. Sorry, forget about it.

00:14:47.380 --> 00:14:49.340
U-uh, no, actually I'll come over!

00:14:49.330 --> 00:14:51.000
It's okay. I'm just fine.

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:51.880
But...

00:14:51.880 --> 00:14:57.260
I just looked out the window and it doesn't seem
like anyone is there. So really, I'm fine.

00:14:57.960 --> 00:15:00.710
If you're going to Sendai,
I want you to bring back some Zunda Mochi.

00:15:03.580 --> 00:15:05.790
Politicians really are scary...

00:15:06.080 --> 00:15:08.710
This means my article
must have had a serious impact.

00:15:10.790 --> 00:15:12.790
Gotansha Publishing

00:15:12.790 --> 00:15:14.750
Minister Hoshikawa Knew the Whole Time!
Secretary Makes Full Confession in Midst of Scandal!!

00:15:13.250 --> 00:15:14.630
We can't use this, Matsukata.

00:15:14.830 --> 00:15:20.120
I want to make sure this gets out. If I don't, then
she's going to end up as the criminal in all of this.

00:15:20.630 --> 00:15:24.340
Revealing an anonymous source is a rule
that you can't break in this industry.

00:15:24.330 --> 00:15:26.540
Not to mention, it's possible
that she may actually have done it.

00:15:26.750 --> 00:15:30.790
Narita-san, you approved that article because
you knew Hoshikawa was a dirty politician, right?

00:15:30.920 --> 00:15:33.420
No, I did it because it's interesting.

00:15:33.630 --> 00:15:36.710
More to the point, our job
is only to write the articles.

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:38.960
We can't get involved in scandals
any further than that.

00:15:38.960 --> 00:15:41.130
Tch. I understand.

00:15:41.130 --> 00:15:44.210
Narita-san, you're not the type
to run aboard a leaving train, I guess.

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:45.710
Exactly, I watch them leave.

00:15:46.710 --> 00:15:49.590
I don't dislike your way of life, Matsukata.

00:15:49.580 --> 00:15:51.000
But only as a spectator.

00:15:52.540 --> 00:15:54.540
Shit. Damn you, adulthood.

00:15:55.000 --> 00:16:03.210
I was growing tired of all his dirty deeds...
or rather, I wanted to bring an end to everything.

00:16:03.830 --> 00:16:07.120
He is vulgar, greedy, idiotic, and selfish.

00:16:07.460 --> 00:16:10.170
And yet he holds power that I could never have.

00:16:08.330 --> 00:16:13.120
Love is something

00:16:10.170 --> 00:16:12.840
You can't escape being pinned down
by a man like that.

00:16:13.130 --> 00:16:14.460
Do you get what I mean?

00:16:14.460 --> 00:16:20.590
Known through tears

00:16:14.460 --> 00:16:17.210
I don't. I don't understand that at all!

00:16:21.130 --> 00:16:26.510
And joy is

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:24.920
I want to write about you
in the next issue, Sekiguchi-san.

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:26.500
I already refused that offer.

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:29.670
Why are you staying quiet
and making yourself the culprit?

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:35.590
The light that illuminates us

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:33.210
If you really wanted, it should be possible for you
to confess to the authorities directly.

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:40.000
It's punishment for my sin...
of knowing but not running away.

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:44.500
See, just take a look

00:16:40.670 --> 00:16:41.750
Farewell.

00:16:46.210 --> 00:16:52.000
You can hear the voices of

00:16:46.380 --> 00:16:50.710
Shinji
Sorry!!
I bought the Zunda Mochi.
Today
I'm coming over.
-Shinji

00:16:46.830 --> 00:16:50.160
I bought the Zunda Mochi. Today I'm coming over. Shinji.

00:16:52.630 --> 00:16:57.050
The children in this same old town

00:16:54.500 --> 00:16:57.040
And our sexless life continues.

00:16:57.040 --> 00:16:59.000
ZUNDA
MOCHI

00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:00.500
The view around us...

00:17:01.960 --> 00:17:07.210
The misappropriation of funds is the heart of this
story, why complicate it by trying to take a side?

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:09.540
But I just can't ignore the truth.

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:15.420
In the end, making this public may serve
to soothe your conscience, but at what cost?

00:17:19.290 --> 00:17:20.210
Fine.

00:17:20.210 --> 00:17:21.630
I'll write it, give me your notes.

00:17:21.630 --> 00:17:22.340
No way!

00:17:22.630 --> 00:17:24.130
But you can't write it any other way, right?

00:17:24.130 --> 00:17:25.010
But...

00:17:27.790 --> 00:17:30.830
Quit being so childish!
This problem goes beyond just you!

00:17:34.130 --> 00:17:36.010
Narita-san never raises his voice...

00:17:36.290 --> 00:17:41.080
You want to make an anonymous source public
without having verified the truth behind the story.

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:46.040
Our company will lose the trust of our network
and the public by betraying an anonymous source.

00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:50.120
On top of that, you've already drawn serious threats
from the people supporting Hoshikawa.

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:53.460
So if you want to move forward,
you need to be ready for even more.

00:17:53.790 --> 00:17:56.000
Are you prepared to handle all that?!

00:17:56.500 --> 00:18:00.500
I can't handle any of that...
I cried just from being followed at night.

00:18:00.670 --> 00:18:02.750
That eel hit the spot!

00:18:02.750 --> 00:18:04.670
Editor-In-Chief! There's trouble!

00:18:04.670 --> 00:18:06.550
Not everything is trouble, you know!

00:18:06.710 --> 00:18:09.710
Who exactly do you think
will end up dealing with all of the blowback?

00:18:09.880 --> 00:18:11.210
The Editor-In-Chief will!

00:18:11.210 --> 00:18:12.040
Huh?

00:18:12.040 --> 00:18:13.420
What will I be doing?

00:18:13.420 --> 00:18:14.380
Ah...

00:18:15.040 --> 00:18:16.040
It's nothing.

00:18:16.040 --> 00:18:18.920
I'm just making sure that she remembers
the reason why she can do her job in peace

00:18:18.920 --> 00:18:22.840
is because you're at the top,
covering for all of us when there's trouble.

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:27.410
I see, that's a great thing to remind people of.

00:18:27.420 --> 00:18:29.300
Narita, you're an excellent supervisor.

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:30.370
It's nothing...

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:31.710
Matsukata!

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:32.420
Yessir!

00:18:35.250 --> 00:18:38.670
That article you pitched earlier,
you can write it however you want.

00:18:38.670 --> 00:18:40.300
I'll take responsibility for it.

00:18:41.040 --> 00:18:42.290
Editor-In-Chief...

00:18:45.540 --> 00:18:48.290
But in exchange, it better be damn convincing.

00:18:52.750 --> 00:18:53.750
Ouch!

00:18:57.790 --> 00:18:59.040
This is bad...

00:18:59.630 --> 00:19:02.920
Why am I struggling so much...
Why can't I just write it?

00:19:03.250 --> 00:19:04.880
Is my conscience holding me back?

00:19:05.710 --> 00:19:09.840
Because my article was used
to set Sekiguchi-san up as the culprit?

00:19:10.670 --> 00:19:13.300
No, the reason goes deeper than that.

00:19:15.540 --> 00:19:20.460
It's because I didn't properly follow up
with Sekiguchi-san. Because I did a half-assed job.

00:19:20.920 --> 00:19:24.710
I'm trying to cover for that
by insisting that we publish her name!

00:19:25.380 --> 00:19:26.300
I've got it!

00:19:27.920 --> 00:19:30.590
I got too involved and lost sight
of the bigger picture.

00:19:31.290 --> 00:19:32.790
Manly switch...

00:19:32.790 --> 00:19:33.750
Activate!

00:19:34.210 --> 00:19:35.790
She's back! Hataraki Man!

00:19:35.790 --> 00:19:37.250
She's gone turbo!

00:19:38.460 --> 00:19:42.590
What I need to do is simply find a way to write
the story without linking it to Sekiguchi-san,

00:19:42.580 --> 00:19:46.370
but still clearly demonstrate to everyone
that Hoshikawa was the real culprit!

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:48.750
Well, that's all for today.

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:49.750
Good work.

00:19:56.170 --> 00:20:01.130
Hoshikawa's
Web of Lies
Exposed!

00:19:56.580 --> 00:19:59.750
Tanaka's article... There are no mistakes,
so I can't complain.

00:20:00.080 --> 00:20:04.460
But the old articles he used for reference
were all written by Matsukata.

00:20:19.960 --> 00:20:20.880
You sure about this?

00:20:22.460 --> 00:20:23.340
Yes.

00:20:24.040 --> 00:20:25.290
You did good work.

00:20:27.250 --> 00:20:30.250
Hey! You know that's my job!

00:20:30.250 --> 00:20:32.710
You're always stealing the spotlight around here!

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:34.130
Ah, I apologize...

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:37.130
Don't worry about it.
People who lead a clumsy lifestyle...

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:39.130
Huh? Are you talking about me?

00:20:39.580 --> 00:20:42.330
...I think they're better off than
those smart types who waste no time.

00:20:44.960 --> 00:20:46.920
Okay, then this is ready for print.

00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:47.830
Right.

00:20:50.250 --> 00:20:51.830
Good morning.

00:20:51.830 --> 00:20:52.540
Hey.

00:20:52.540 --> 00:20:53.290
Morning.

00:20:58.920 --> 00:21:05.170
"My work was essentially my life"... Personally,
I refuse to die with that as my final thought.

00:21:06.710 --> 00:21:07.790
That's relatable.

00:21:08.630 --> 00:21:11.590
Part of me feels that way too, I'm certain of it.

00:21:11.960 --> 00:21:12.960
However...

00:21:13.880 --> 00:21:17.840
I want to die thinking, "Damn, I did good work."

00:21:31.080 --> 00:21:32.460
Shangri-la

00:21:32.460 --> 00:21:37.710
Yume no naka de sae umaku waraenai kimi no koto
Even in my dreams you can't manage a proper smile

00:21:37.710 --> 00:21:43.040
Dame na hitotte shikari nagara aishiteitai
I just want to chide and love a hopeless person like you

00:21:46.250 --> 00:21:50.000
Kimi o omouto kyou mo nemurenai
Today I thought about you and now I can't sleep

00:21:50.000 --> 00:21:53.580
Bokura doko he mukaouka
Where shall we go?

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:59.040
Ahh... ahh...

00:22:00.920 --> 00:22:02.300
Shangri-la

00:22:02.290 --> 00:22:06.250
Shiawasedatte sakende kureyo
Let me hear you shout "I'm happy!"

00:22:06.250 --> 00:22:10.580
Ijippari na kimi no nakigao misete kureyo
Let me see the tears underneath your tough exterior

00:22:10.580 --> 00:22:12.250
Shangri-la

00:22:12.250 --> 00:22:17.210
Kimi o omouto kyou mo nemurenai boku no koto
Today I thought about you and now I can't sleep

00:22:17.210 --> 00:22:22.250
Dame na hitotte shikarinagara ashitekure
Please chide and love a hopeless person like me

00:22:21.710 --> 00:22:25.460
Shinji
Nice Work Today
Do your best, but don't
wear yourself out.
-Shinji

00:22:31.000 --> 00:22:35.830
Next Episode: Stakeout Man
